Mandatory Skills: Good Attitude

Trail Buddies: >>> remove

Rigs: 1/10 scale electronic 
No Bashers
1.55, 1.9, 2.2 wheel class. 
No dig or rear steer
5 scale accessories minimum

The Park
Adventure Off Road Park in South Pittsburg, TN  is a 600 acre private ridge.
The Pavillon will be base camp hub of all activities: 
Registration
Driver’s Meeting
Hot Dog Dinner
Awards and 50/50 Raffle
Fire Pit
Camping Onsite is first come first served.


The Map
On day map comprised of GPS data, indicating high traffic hot spots and built from real terrain data. Use it at the Pavillon and during each stage. 

Every line traces back to where it came from.


The Crew
We are the Rock Warblers [insert rock warbler call]. We are kin to the Diamond-Billed Rock Pecker that can be found exclusively in Moab, UT. We are known for our bright blue shirts and ultimate scale builds. Rock Warblers can be found primarily east of the Mississippi River. Rock Warblers have been spotted in Canada, Pennsylvania, West Virginia, Michigan, and North Carolina. A rare breed has been observed migrating between Europe and North America. 
